<body>
<div type="letter">
<pb facs="1039008" n="282v"/>
  <p>Occorrendomi d’andar à <rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Venezia</rs> la settimana ventura per certi
      <lb/>affari e di starvi alcune settimane, hò stimato convenevole
      <lb/>darne notizia à <choice><abbr>V<supplied>.</supplied></abbr><expan>Vostra</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>S<supplied>.</supplied></abbr><expan>Signoria</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>Ill.<hi rend="sup">ma</hi></abbr><expan>Illustrissima</expan></choice> accioche io possi avanti la mia
      <lb/>partenza ricever l’onore de’ suoi <abbr>riverit.<hi rend="sup">mi</hi></abbr> co<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>andi. Con
      <lb/>questa occasione <del><gap/></del><add>le partecipo,</add> che hò avuto
      <lb/><del><gap/></del><add>aviso</add> da casa mia dell’arrivo de’ Libri colà inviati,<del><gap/></del>
      <lb/><del><gap/></del>e che <del><gap/></del><add><choice><abbr>V<supplied>.</supplied></abbr><expan>Vostra</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>S<supplied>.</supplied></abbr><expan>Signoria</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>Ill.<hi rend="sup">ma</hi></abbr><expan>Illustrissima</expan></choice> è</add> riverita <del><gap/></del>umilmente dal mio <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-135542472"><del><gap/></del><add>C</add>ugino</rs>
      <lb/>figlio del defunto <abbr><abbr>Sig.<hi rend="sup">r</hi></abbr></abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509950" type="person">Giacomo <abbr>Bern.</abbr></rs> come ancora dal
      <lb/><abbr>Sig.<hi rend="sup">r</hi></abbr> di <rs key="pers_DE-588-117601020" type="person">Monmort</rs>, il quale in una <rs type="letter">lettera</rs> da me poco fà rice<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/><add>v</add>uta me supplica <quote><foreign xml:lang="fre"><hi rend="u">de Vous faire les tres humbles complimens</hi></foreign></quote>.
      <lb/>Prego <choice><abbr>V<supplied>.</supplied></abbr><expan>Vostra</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>S<supplied>.</supplied></abbr><expan>Signoria</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>Ill.<hi rend="sup">ma</hi></abbr><expan>Illustrissima</expan></choice> se <add>à Lei</add> capitera<choice><orig><g ref="#nn">n̄</g></orig><reg>nn</reg></choice>o alcune mie Lettere di spedirle al <abbr>Sig.<hi rend="sup">r</hi></abbr> <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Michelotti</rs> e di conservarmi l’onore della sua buona grazia.</p>
  <closer>Riverisco divotamente l’<abbr>Ill.<hi rend="sup">ma</hi></abbr> <abbr>Sig.<hi rend="sup">ra</hi></abbr> <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-1365389650">Consorte</rs> e mi con<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>fermo di <choice><abbr>V<supplied>.</supplied></abbr><expan>Vostra</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>S<supplied>.</supplied></abbr><expan>Signoria</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>Ill.<hi rend="sup">ma</hi></abbr><expan>Illustrissima</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>Umil.<hi rend="sup">mo</hi></abbr><expan>Umilissimo</expan></choice> et <choice><abbr>Obblig.<hi rend="sup">mo</hi></abbr><expan>Obbligatissimo</expan></choice> servo <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person"><abbr>NB</abbr></rs>.
                        <dateline><rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Padova</rs> <date when="1718-07-29">29. Luglio 1718.</date></dateline></closer>
</div>
</body>
